# The bundled analyzers (PRD 41 A3) ship whole: typescript needs its lib.*.d.ts at runtime, and the
# rules above (**/*.ts, **/*.map, **/tsconfig.json) must not strip any package under out/analyzers.
!out/analyzers/**
